      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hearing you speak about this level of pain and the desire for quiet is deeply concerning, and I want you to know that what you are feeling is a sign of immense suffering, not insanity. The thought of permanently stopping is a sign of acute distress, and your safety is the absolute priority right now. Please know that there are immediate, confidential lifelines available to help manage this unbearable pressure. You can call or text 988 in the US and Canada anytime to speak with someone who is trained to listen without judgment.",
